  "description": "Written before the page. Hero (one viewport), then a sticky 500vh stage that scrubs one stage-local progress s through four chapters: FILL [0,.25), SAVE [.25,.5), COMPACT [.5,.75), REHYDRATE [.75,1]. Every scrubbed value is a linear function of s (family: exploded-blueprint-mono, scroll seeks one timeline); label and chapter reveals are 250ms cubic-out time transitions (exploded-blueprint-mono#2). Token numbers are the e2e run of 2026-11-03 (91k before, 28k engine count after, manifest STATE.md 7.6k + auth.ts 6.7k, checkpoint 0.8k). Total height corrected to the measured 8098px after the first capture (spec assumed 7600). 2026-11-05 (0.5 content): two sections added inside the evidence scene, so the total is 10,015px; positions remapped so every hero and stage sample lands on the same pixel as before, evidence samples spread over its new range.",
